    "f-richtext-1721189762N8hzD-text_html": "Use the unique promo code (the \"Code\") you received via Instagram Influencer to get 15% off your next order from THE FUTURE ROCKS (<a href=\"http://www.thefuturerocks.com\">www.thefuturerocks.com</a>), subject to the terms and conditions (the \"Terms and Conditions\") of the promotion.",
